Source: zeroc-icee
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Francisco Moya <francisco.moya@uclm.es>
Build-Depends: cdbs (>= 0.4.27-1), debhelper (>= 4.2.0), slice2cppe (>= 1.1.0)
Standards-Version: 3.6.2

Package: zeroc-icee
Architecture: all
Section: devel
Depends: libicee-dev, libicee-java, libicee-midp, icee-slice, icee-translators
Description: Embedded edition of the ZeroC Ice
 ZeroC Ice is a CORBA-like middleware solution. IceE is a subset of
 Ice used in embedded systems. This is a dummy package that depends
 on the full set of IceE packages.

Package: libiceec11
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: ZeroC IceE for C++ client runtime libraries
 ZeroC Ice is a CORBA-like middleware solution. IceE is a subset of
 Ice used in embedded systems. This package installs the runtime
 libraries needed for IceE C++ clients.

Package: libicee11
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: ZeroC IceE for C++ server runtime libraries
 ZeroC Ice is a CORBA-like middleware solution. IceE is a subset of
 Ice used in embedded systems. This package installs the runtime
 libraries needed for IceE C++ servers.

Package: libicee-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: libiceec11, libicee11, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: ZeroC IceE for C++ development libraries
 ZeroC Ice is a CORBA-like middleware solution. IceE is a subset of
 Ice used in embedded systems. This package installs the development
 libraries and include files needed for IceE C++ development.

Package: icee-slice
Architecture: all
Section: devel
Description: Slice definitions for ZeroC IceE services
 ZeroC Ice is a CORBA-like middleware solution. IceE is a subset of
 Ice used in embedded systems. This package installs the Slice
 definitions of standard IceE services on /usr/share/slice.
